# bamr87 hub — what this repository generates, and nothing else.
# (It used to be a copy of a home-directory ignore file; its `github/` pattern
# silently hid tools/console/web/src/github/ from git.)

# ---- dependencies + caches --------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.venv/
venv/
.venv-console/
.venv-mcp/
.venv-tui/
.venv-docs/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---- lockfiles — never committed: fleet ALWAYS-LATEST dependency policy -----
# (_data/fleet.yml `dependencies:` + docs/DEPENDENCIES.md)
package-lock.json
npm-shrinkwrap.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
Gemfile.lock
poetry.lock
Pipfile.lock
uv.lock
composer.lock
.terraform.lock.hcl
# BEGIN sanctioned_lockfiles: generated from specs/QUALITY.contract.yml
# (UPS-QA-40 hub-only exception). One `!<lockfile>` per entry, after the
# patterns above; tools/check-drift.sh (j) fails when this block drifts.
!.github/site-quality/package-lock.json
# END sanctioned_lockfiles

# ---- build outputs -----------------------------------------------------------
# _site/: the public site as build-dash.yml builds it (tools/console/build-pages.sh)
_site/
dist/
dist-pages/
site/
build/
*.egg-info/

# ---- generated data that is never committed ----------------------------------
_data/project_health.yml
_data/project_health_meta.yml
_data/ai_activity.yml
# Ephemeral agent work orders: remediate → the fleet-pulse doctor; the
# issue-pipeline tiers; dash-gen targets → repo-evolution.yml. Each is shipped as
# a workflow artifact, never as a commit.
remediation-workorder.md
issue-workorder-t*.md
evolution-workorders/
scout-workorders/
# The local data lake (dash-gen lake) — it holds run logs.
.dash-lake/
# Per-submodule compose overrides generated by `dash-gen compose`.
.fleet/compose/
# Per-node compose overlays + OpenTofu inputs from `dash node gen` (_data/fleet.yml
# `nodes:`, docs/PLATFORM.md). OpenTofu's own state and plans live outside the tree
# (nodes.infra.state_dir); these patterns catch a hand-run `tofu` in infra/.
.fleet/nodes/
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
# Local loop runs (python3 -m tools.jev loop): plans, prompts, redacted traces,
# publish previews. The clones themselves live outside the hub, in ~/.cache/jev/work.
.fleet/runs/
# Refinement evidence trees (python3 -m tools.jev refine evidence): redacted
# trajectories, deliverables and the tunable harness a proposer session reads.
.fleet/refine/
# dash projects: plan previews (.fleet/backfill/plan-*.json) and the § 11 write audit
# (github-writes.jsonl, token values redacted); the decisions themselves are
# committed in _data/projects_backfill.yml.
.fleet/backfill/
# dash pm: the routine PM review's local files (model, review, board plan preview);
# the public snapshot is committed as _data/pm_review.yml.
.fleet/pm/
# The MCP layer's scoped-write audit (audit.jsonl: one line per job_dispatch,
# job_cancel and work_apply call, values scrubbed; tools/console/docs/mcp-layer.md).
.fleet/mcp/
# Evidence sandboxes built by tools/issue-evidence.sh.
.evidence/
# The agent verification loop's exchange files (fleet-verify.yml /
# verify/runner.mjs). Evidence BUNDLES under test/evidence/<slug>/ are
# committed deliberately (docs/VERIFICATION.md).
verify/BRIEF.md
verify/AGENT-REPORT.md
test/evidence/agent/
test/evidence/report.json
verify-app.log
verify-run.txt
mkdocs-build.log

# ---- secrets + machine-local ------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.bak*
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/skills/run-dash/*.png
.playwright-mcp/
.codex/
.frontmatter/
.harmonize/

# ---- editors + OS -----------------------------------------------------------
# .vscode/ is ignored except the shared config this repo deliberately tracks
# (the editor front door, constitution § 20; tools/test_vscode_launch.py holds
# this list equal to the files .vscode/SCHEMA.md declares).
.vscode/*
!.vscode/README.md
!.vscode/SCHEMA.md
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Host-side process snapshot for the console /live page (tools/console/live_collector.py).
.dash-live/
